sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Beginner
    participant CC as Claude Code
    participant L as Langflow Server
    participant F as Flow

    U->>CC: "Create a Python script to run my flow"
    CC->>CC: Reads .env.example and flow ID notes
    CC->>L: POST /api/v1/run/{FLOW_ID}\nx-api-key + input_value
    L->>F: Execute components
    F-->>L: Chat output result
    L-->>CC: JSON response
    CC-->>U: Prints answer and saves script
